			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Redesign of communication between client and server by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/77\n* Update block settings by @MadsSR in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/79\n* Remove size limit of program sent through packets by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/80\n* Fix invalid tick crash when onStateReplaced is called repeatedly by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/82\n* Fix number overflow by @MadsSR in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/83\n* Add mod and div error message by @MadsSR in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/92\n* Fix step peek-warning printed multiple times when speed is 10 by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/95\n* Fix multiple crashes, threading problem and scoping inconsistency within functions by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/103\n* Fix pow incorrect precedence/associativity by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/106\n* Add unit tests by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/107\n* Fix max payload limit of ~1MB by @sabotack in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/108\n* Fix scope error by @MadsSR in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/109\n* Add integration tests by @ViktorPlatz in https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/pull/110\n\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MadsSR/MineScript/compare/v0.0.1+1.19.4...v0.1.0+1.19.4"
